    "title": "Road Closure of Mountain Drive on July 8 and 9 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By CityofSantaBarbara ,\n1 days ago On Wednesday, July 8, the southbound lane of Mountain Drive will be closed between the intersection of Mountain Drive and Los Olivos Street/Mission Canyon Road. On Thursday, July 9, both lanes of Mountain Drive will be closed between the intersection of Mountain Drive and Los Olivos Street/Mission Canyon Road, as well as the intersection of Mountain Drive and Mission Ridge Road. Read full article",
